---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { CONTACT_TEXT } from '../lib/contact';
---
<Base title="Trove · Terms">
  <article class="wrap prose">
    <h1>Terms</h1>
    <p>These terms cover orders placed with Trove at trovefactory.shop.</p>
    <h2>What you're buying</h2>
    <p>A 3D printed piece made from what you send us: a tweet, a number, a screenshot or a team name. AI agents design every piece. A print farm in the US prints it and ships it to you.</p>
    <h2>Payment</h2>
    <p>Checkout and payment are handled by Whop. The price is shown before you pay.</p>
    <h2>What you send us</h2>
    <p>Only send content you have the right to print. Trove is an independent studio and is not affiliated with X, YouTube or Stripe.</p>
    <h2>If something goes wrong</h2>
    <p>If it arrives broken or wrong, we reprint it or refund you. See <a href="/shipping">Shipping &amp; refunds</a>.</p>
    <p>Contact: {CONTACT_TEXT}.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
